        },
        "text": "Reflecting on metaverse brand business models and NFT utilities after NFT NYC, a thread:"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1465832978022473733",
        "created_at": "2022-07-02T13:55:32.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1543231905759252480"
        ],
        "id": "1543231905759252480",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 1,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 5,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 9,
          "retweet_count": 2
        },
        "text": "321看项目 day14\n@WeatherXM  \n理论机制上是可以实现的一个web3天气预报项目\n\n购买WXM矿机，矿工们获取当地天气数据\n随着去中心化的矿工网络搭建起来\n数据的精准度也会增长\n\n但这个类似于应用层+公链模式的叠加\n很吃运营资源\n也很需要财富效应和团队市场的认可度\n\n一条很难但有实用性的路"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1465832978022473733",
        "created_at": "2022-07-01T15:52:54.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1542899053922463744"
        ],
        "id": "1542899053922463744",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 2,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 2,
          "retweet_count": 1
        },
        "text": "321 看项目day13\n@cradlesio \n之前的租赁EIP协议通过，带动了一个热点\n\ncradles也是订阅制协议的探索\nNFT也都是会衰老死亡的\n\nMMO还是会有一个跑出来的游戏的\n虽然面临着玩家数量较少的问题\n\n但是MMO是最有希望能长期运营的游戏种类之一\n但是我的思考是MMO只开小游戏打金\n整体不打金\n大概就可控可长期"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1435990322702520320",
        "created_at": "2022-07-01T03:02:27.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1542705163378360320"
        ],
        "id": "1542705163378360320",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1435990322702520320",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 0,
          "like_count": 6,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 4,
